Note on scope: this repository contains attack *research* — test scripts, prompts and
raw logs produced against accounts the author controlled, using a synthetic canary string
and publicly documented test PII. Running any script here against a system you do not own
or are not authorized to test may violate that operator's terms of service and local law.
The MIT license above grants rights to the code; it grants no authorization to attack
any third-party system.
